      <activity id="84cb5252-30be-56eb-a249-6b2293b03592" activityNameId="1024b8fa-f81e-5d5e-97c7-9429626e7632" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Door, outer, aluminium, opaque filling, at regional storage</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Door, outer, aluminium, opaque filling, at regional storage
The share of imported aluminium doors was estimated at 25%. The production of imported doors is modelled by the dataset for Switzerland including a 10% surcharge. The main countries of origin are Germany and Poland. The average transport distance was estimated based on the geographic centre of these countries.;
UUID: da70640b-e2aa-397d-b81d-ce5b17ec44bd
Included are the production of outer doors with opaque filling and the transport of imported doors to a regional storage in Switzerland.
Location: Data apply to the supply in Switzerland.
Technology: Industry data.
Time period: Time of publications.
Production volume: na
Sampling: Estimate by a producer of aluminium doors. 
Extrapolations: Some generic datasets from ecoinvent have been used.
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_da70640b-e2aa-397d-b81d-ce5b17ec44bd.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
